      "description": "Edits a spell project in any page, in Monaco, saving back to the spell server;  compiles as it opens, after typing stops and on Cmd+Enter, and feeds `<spell-viewer>`s what it compiled.",
      "noun": "editor",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "project",
          "kind": "string",
          "description": "What to edit, from the spell server's `/api`, as `<spell-viewer project>`:  `@spell/examples/Solitaire`.  Edits SAVE back to it:  every compile saves the files edited since, and Cmd+S saves."
        },
        {
          "name": "file",
          "kind": "string",
          "description": "Which file to show first, e.g. `Card.spell`;  default, its first spell file.  Tabs show the others."
        },
