      "description": "Spell markdown draws GitHub-flavoured markdown with spell's own engine, in `ui-*` elements -- headers, lists, tables, alerts as messages, tasks as checkboxes -- plain or `editable`.  Its spell blocks are coloured by spell's parser.",
